+## Scale and Load
+
+Rows cover the paths whose cost scales with stored data. A size nobody has recorded is treated as bounded, so the simplest readable form is the design.
+
+| Path | Dominant operations | Realistic size | Access pattern | Form |
+|------|---------------------|----------------|----------------|------|
+| Specialty directory (`REQ-VET-003`) | One read of every specialty; one cached read of every veterinarian; group holders under each specialty; sort both levels | Unrecorded, treated as bounded; the seed holds three specialties and six veterinarians | Read-only, whole collection on every request, no paging | In-memory grouping over the two full collections, then sorting. Worst-case time is linear in veterinarian–specialty pairs plus the sorts; space is linear in the same pairs |
+
 ## Dependency Policy
 
 Minimize external dependencies. Every dependency is an attack surface and a maintenance burden.
